Verse 1:
[E]Cause [F#m]me [G#m]to hear [E]Thy [F#m]loving [G#m]kindness [F#m]in [G#m]the morning,
[A#m]for in Thee [Cm]do I trust.
[F]Cause me [C]to [Dm]know they way [Cm]where-in [D#]I shall [Fm]walk
[D#dim]for I lift up my soul to Thee.
[B7]Amen
